Sortformer conversion tools for AnySpeechRecognizer

This directory contains code derived from möbius by Fluid Inference
(https://github.com/FluidInference/mobius), commit
26f5fa8059d5ab3d34449adce6ff6ed86734e522, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Derived files and their sources, all under
models/speaker-diarization/sortformer-streaming/conversion/:

- sortformer.py: fixed_concat_and_pad, PreEncoderWrapper, and HeadWrapper from
  coreml_wrappers.py (fixed_concat_and_pad, PreEncoderWrapper, and
  SortformerHeadWrapper).
- convert.py: conversion settings, pipeline assembly, metadata keys, and
  compilation from convert_to_coreml.py and build_all_variants.py.

The same scripts are also published, in earlier versions, in the Hugging Face
repository FluidInference/diar-streaming-sortformer-coreml; this directory
derives from the möbius versions only.

The wrappers call and follow NVIDIA NeMo (https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo),
Copyright (c) 2025 NVIDIA CORPORATION, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0: HeadWrapper follows SortformerEncLabelModel.forward_for_export, and
the streaming loop in verify.py follows forward_streaming_step.

The files were modified for AnySpeechRecognizer.
The modifications are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The tools do not contain model weights.
The model they convert is licensed separately under CC BY 4.0:

- Streaming Sortformer 4spk v2 by NVIDIA
  (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/diar_streaming_sortformer_4spk-v2)
